4	// csrc/fused/gfx942/fused_megakernel.hip.hpp — REAL component-composition
5	// L3/L1 persistent megakernel for gfx942 (CDNA3 / MI300X). AMD twin of
6	// csrc/fused/sm_90/fused_megakernel.cuh.
7	//
8	// Composes the REAL optimizer device-function component (opt_components.hip.hpp
9	// → apply_optimizer<OptId>, all 11 real, no fallback) with the REAL model stage
10	// component (model_stages.hip.hpp) over the shared gfx942 persistent substrate
11	// (megakernel_common_hip.hip.hpp: task queue, CU-pin, hand-built GridBarrier).
12	// It REPLACES the deleted toy demo opt_update (4 opts + AdamW fallback) with the
13	// real all-11 apply. §1.13 ping-pong / 4-wave-interleave scheduling (no Hopper
14	// warp-spec analog on CDNA3).
